30	// `extraDiskCentsAt` were still imported after `renewalCharge` moved out to
31	// ./renewal-charge, leaving this file holding every ingredient of the renewal
32	// formula and nothing that used them — an invitation to write the second copy that
33	// lib/renewal-quote.ts documents two incidents about. The one formula lives in
34	// ./renewal-charge and is re-exported below.
