166	/**
167	 * Hosted Checkout session in `mode: "setup"` — how a customer saves a card.
168	 *
169	 * Checkout rather than Stripe Elements because there is no Elements/Stripe.js
170	 * integration anywhere in this codebase and no publishable key plumbed to the
171	 * browser; a redirect to Stripe's own page reuses the exact flow that already
172	 * takes money for deploys, upgrades and top-ups.
173	 *
174	 * `usage: "off_session"` is load-bearing: it records a mandate that covers the
175	 * unattended renewal charges we make later. Without it many issuers (and every
176	 * SCA-regulated card) reject the first off-session charge outright, which would
177	 * turn "saved card" into "card that is declined once a month".
